{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：22:15 2026-11-10 HKT<br/>發佈時間：22:15 2026-11-10 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：22:15 2026-11-10 HKT</p><p>陳曉華在TVB節目巡禮中只有《驅魔速遞》一套劇，對於她今年有4套劇播出，但來年只有一劇，她承認今年是多產：「今年只係拍咗一套，重質不重量！」又指《驅》中有大量動作戲，更會有踢腿動作。至於《新聞女王III》，陳曉華就指正等待通知。</p><img alt=\"戴祖儀、陳曉華、周嘉洛、吳偉豪演《驅魔速遞》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/bb5de6881fc2b8d15bb9b64f40daf486/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-10_at_18_29_22_0.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"周嘉洛與陳曉華劇中有感情線。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cb863a4fdccd784b90b290cbc9c15b40/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-10_at_18_29_26_0.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"陳曉華在TVB節目巡禮中明年只有《驅魔速遞》一套劇。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b7be542265b5385172dc04abf0be8bb9/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-10_at_18_29_28_1__0.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"《驅魔速遞》中周嘉洛衝出搞笑角色。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e32bff7513df8cf70704dee9d38e9715/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-10_at_18_29_29_1__0.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"陳曉華和周嘉洛是好拍檔。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8844edc60d5058702fc1c7fa63e982a1/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-10_at_18_29_30_2__0.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"她今年有4套劇播出。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1fb638bbef279bba896b051c6c5efe45/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-10_at_18_29_32_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"她堅持重質不重量。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/29fd1994f229986ebcb4e595c5395243/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-10_at_18_29_32.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"《驅魔速遞》宣傳海報。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7aa68878012aa4faae9f0f6bf09e23a4/2026-11/179431895576424.jpg\"/><p>至於周嘉洛就表示在《驅》中與陳曉華是有感情線，又指今次自己跟過往搞笑的角色不同。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T19:46:18.908590+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":238,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T14:15:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T01:23:38.508633+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T19:39:54.852568+00:00","content_hash":"362b5ba2e50097ab499b8c1132b05c88ef8f19d0869103e325dbdebf3c173a81","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}